{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About <i>Pachi-Pachi Typing</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Pachi-Pachi Typing</i> is a game that combines the short-ST (Special Time) experience of pachinko with the score-attack style of a typing game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By winning the lottery draw, players enter either \u201cLive Bonus\u201d or \u201cSpecial Live Bonus\u201d mode, during which they can type to earn points.<br>The duration of each bonus mode differs, and when the timer expires, another lottery draw begins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through this cycle, players aim for high scores based on both luck and skill.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25cf Typing Words</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game mainly features terminology from <strong>pachinko and slot machines</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Words you've fully typed will be added to your <strong>Dictionary</strong>, where you'll be able to read explanations \u2014 this feature is planned for future implementation.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Characters, etc.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Characters such as <strong>Tsukasa Sasaoka</strong> and <strong>Himeka Sakura</strong> appear, shared with other <i>Honwaka-Fuwafuwa</i> titles like <i>Replay Bell Suika Slot-Like Game</i>.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"\u5ea7\u3063\u3066\uff01","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4106900/500ac19d489febb379088930ceb40f80e7847f1d.jpg"},{"name":"\u30b3\u30b3\u3092\u72d9\u3063\u3066\uff01","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4106900/1c12acf3976f87cc59477efb121f9d8f04895e2e.jpg"},{"name":"\u304a\u75b2\u308c\u69d8\uff01","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4106900/e601c5a752dcb6f00964cc0910555aed6caf9bfe.jpg"},{"name":"\u8ae6\u3081\u306a\u3044\uff01","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4106900/e35c33d7ae37148acfd7f051b6c9ef43c14